作者: 烈火(fire)
题目: About the tasklist.
日期: Sun Jan 23 19:03:44 2000
Recently, because I just work, so I am too busy to spend
much time here. Now it seems I get certain reputation in
our company, so I have more free time to do what I like,
Therefore I will be here about two hours each day at about
 7:00-9:00 am. So it is time for us to finish some long term
tasks in the MUD. As far as I know, flee and group are 
doing war stuffs such as jimou and multi-type troops. Row and
Ice don't have major tasks this moment. The following is
a draft tasklist for our wiz team. Please discuss and put
comments.
1 Row and Ice try to build a law system. I think we all have
  some unpleasant experience to handle confilcts among players.
  I assume the best way to get rid of this kind of headache is
  to settle some law and let's players to deal it themselves.
  Now we have a constitution. But we still need at least some
  law about penalty, reward and rules to handle the conflict 
  among players. I suggest row and ice to do the following things:
  a. write some clear rules for penalty, reward and recover issues.
  b. try to build a court and give rules for a player to become
     a judge or a member of the jury. So for any players' petition.
     It will become a case in the court, and the final decision will
     be given by the court (the judge, jury and lawer will be only 
     players. The wiz will be just someone to execute :)
  c. In order to realize this law system. Row and Ice need to write
     some ideas and the working process first. Then begin to code.
     I think we need some rooms, a board and a channel at least to
     realize this kind of thing.
  d. Anything envolve wizs or system security will go directly to wiz 
     committee. (The player court just handle conflicts among players).
  e. Row and Ice will be the only wizs who have the right to recover
     players data or do some penalty which is decided by the players'
     account. 
2 Flee and Group will continue the jimou and multi troop until they are
  finished. They have done a lot good work, but I am not clear about the
  details. I'd like them to give clear documents and put everything in 
  the help so we can easily test.
3 I will continue the house system and begin the frame of base system.
  I am going to make it very flexible and extendable. When the structure
  work is done, other wizs and adjust it and add new stuffs very easily.
  And I will also responsible to give clearly documents for this part.
4 Tset doesn't login regularly. So we can't rely her on any tasks. But
  if she has time, please go around and try to pick up something she like:)
5 Stefan is successfully get us this new server. He will continue on the
  MudOs work and responalbe the opening mirrors and web designing.
In this tasklist, we have 5 tasks, the first three related to the game 
designing of this MUD. I hope the the major developer in each task group 
(point row, flee), please post your detailed plan and schedules.


