日期: Mon Dec 27 16:28:42 1999
1 put the new start on the new server. 
  The most advantage is the when we are testing, there were no players
  around to disturb. But we need the server to be ready to code in the
  mid of January. And there will be at least 24 hours for us to prepare
  in the new server before opening it to players. If the new server can't
  be ready in the middle of next January, we have to restart the mud on
  the old server first.
2 About player nations.
  Since no body unify the whole China in this round. So in next round,
  there will be no player counties. There will be only 16 NPC countries.
  The country arrangement can be check by "info r".
3 About 国师
  国师's power will be the same, but to become a 国师 need more national
  contribution. Currently it is 300. How about change it to 500?
4 The requirement for becoming an officer will be adjustment, the same as
  to become a local leader (some will according to lch's post)
5 If somebody interested, we may redesign the start page. (The current page
  is very good indeed, but a new front page give ppl the impression that
  we are new:)
6 About Independence
  The requirement is about the same, but we may add some penalty for a king 
  when his country is ruined. It will discourage ppl to got independence 
  just for some poket money. 
7 About countries
  Now flee has add the surrender for nation. It is ok. We will create ally for
  countries.
8 About other new stuff
  Any wizs if have new stuff which is
  a no much relationship with other big systems.
  b nearly done.
  Please apply so we can put it in the new start scheme.
9 About the players data
  Players' following data will be cleared
  a. national contribution
  b. local contribution
  c. national position
  d. local position
  Other data such as money, jiewei, liturate, house, and personal
stuffs will be 
  kept.
10 Schedule
  a I hope the plan can be determined before 1st January.
  b A tasklist will be add one day after the plan is approved.
  c the total code will be finished before 13th January.
  d the code will be tested and all data will be transfered before
14th January
  e The new start will be on 15th January
Please discuss and support :)


