作者: 烈火(fire)
题目: About restart
日期: Mon Dec 27 15:34:54 1999
Since everybody supports to restart. We will restart this mud. The
only difference is some people expect a "better plan" and "something
different" in the new era, and Stefan suggest we restart until we got
a new server. I think that is fine.

However, a better plan can not come from nowhere; there must be some ppl
to make it and to realize it. On the other hand, we can't expect that
a new start can solve everything. But definately a new start can bring 
new hopes and new excitings in some way. Generally speaking, what a new
year can bring to us? Nothing new, the same people and the same world. 
(of course, the world is changing, but it changes all the time, there is
no big leap among the new years) But we still use a lot energy to celebrate 
new years. And the coming new year is even special, it leads to a new century 
and I believe none of us can survive longer enough to meet the next turn 
of this big event. So I think it is a enough execuse for us to abort this 
round of Sanguo and to restart a new one.

About the plan. I have asked rob to make one, but seem he is not quite
good to make detailed plans. I will give a draft plan soon. And we can 
discuss it.


