well, i got an idea as the following:

when a player finger
%^H_YELLOW%^finger%^RESET%^

31 位玩家目前正在游戏中。(Mon Jul 12 21:51:37 1999)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
rabbit         player      19m  rabbit
xixixi         player      3m   zudi
lsk            player      1m   lsk
zlong          player           zlong
zudi           player      13m  zudi
theking        player           theking
everyday       player           everyday
