york           player           york
daitoue        player           daitoue
richel         player           richel
cdd            player           cdd
feeling        player      6m   daitoue
xxcdd          player           cdd


When a player login, finger will show his id instead of showing ip
from the player finger, when he tries to login more than 1 id, finger
may indicate the 2nd id or later ids by using the first logged in id.
if the first id logged out, the 2nd one will be the indicator.

I think this way can make players know better to control dummy spies,
however, if sb really wants to make some spies, he has to quit his id
and play his dummy to get his target player's trust, i think it's the
way to solve the currently dummy spy problem.

Well, if a ppl has more than 1 IP to play with, i think we cannot
control at all, it's not a problem of multilog any more, so i think
it's not much concerning about fair, after all, we cannot treat every
player equally fair...:P

looking forward for discussion
* dream





