作者: Fire
题目: IMPORTANT, ALL WIZARDS PLEASE READ CAREFULLY
日期: Tue Dec  1 13:16:51 1998
This is the board just used to post news related to 
wizard committee. Now we have five members in this 
committee they are stefan, tset, flee, row and fire.
This board is used to collect suggestions (each 
suggestion should be solved as approve or unapprove
within no more than one week) and post members opinion
on suggestions. Every wizards has right to give 
suggestion( just post here). once just make one suggestion.
If you have more, please post them differently so we 
can discuss them differently. and make the suggestion 
clear. (an obscure suggestion may be refused). 
Every member of the committee is supposed to post
his opionion about each suggestion clearly and quickly.
He should make it clear that he supports one suggestion
or against. Expra explain and comment are also welcomed.
After one suggestion is given, each member is expected
to give his opinion by post here. If he did post anything
about that suggestion within one week. we will consider
this situation by two ways. one is that he has login during
that time another is that he didn't login in that time.
If he indeed login in that time but didn't give any respond
about a suggestion, we will take it as he SUPPORT that
suggestion as DEFAULT and this will reduce his reputation
in this committee for not fulfiling his duty. If he didn't
login during that period, then we will remove his name out
of the committee temporarily. and the result of this suggestion
will be determined by a smaller group of the committee.
Did I make this rules clear? any one has anything unclearly,
please just post your question out. And this rules will be
approved unless more than one committee member post agains it.
If no more than one ppl against this, this will be used
until we other suggestion against this rules approved.
xixi:)
cheers
fire


