作者: 烈火(fire)
题目: The work as an admin in the mirror site.
日期: Wed Feb 23 17:49:35 2000
The admin in the mirror site will not going to do and programming
there. The reason is simple, he can't even view the source code
in the mirror site. Now I list what an admin may do in a mirror.
1 To watch and report bugs 
  As you all know, because our system is much more complex than 
  other Chinese Mud, so there are many bugs in our system. This
  maybe even more obvious in a new mirror. For example because the
  lack of severl news group caused some room unaccessable is a very
  typical bug in mirrors. To watch bug is simple, just need
  a chan errors /on        This will open the error message channel
  b When find some error message, use 
    dbxwhere last,  to findout which files caused the bug and some
    information.
  c Then use dbxframe last <frame number> to view the source code which
    caused the error message. and report them to main site.

2 To handle urgent events.
  In most situation, the bug doesn't cause too much trouble, but 
  sometimes, it may cause a player traped in a mache or in the war field.
  In this case, they need urgent help from a wiz.
  In certain cases, bugs may cause disaster lose for a country or an area,
  and we are responsible to recover their lose.

3 To find if there are some ways to cheat in our mud.
  New players may find new ways to cheat. One example is they find can
  give other players money by type put gold in <sb>. 

4 Help new players.
  Our mud is so different from other chinese muds that many players find
  it's hard to begin in our mud. Even though we have plenty help files,
  few players have the patient to read at begining and some of the helps
  are missleading. I have goto Tsing's BBS and find there is a warm discuss
  about our mud. But I find none of the post can really tell others what
  our mud is like. In other word, few ppl really understand what mud it is.
  So we need some highhand and wizs from main site to help them getting 
  start.

5 Post and announce the new progress
  Now several systems are under development, and each day we may release 
  something new. So the admin in the mirror need announce and post these
  progresses.

6 Deal with complains.
  Different site may have different problems. xfan has raise two problem.
  One is use channnel to flood, another is a none char player will lost
  most of his stuff when disconnected, which are quite common on his site.
  When we got these complain, we can modify our code to solve the problems.
  If we can't, it's better to give some explains.

Anyway, a mirror difinately need an admin from main site to work there. And
it's not necessary to be the programer.
Of cause, I can do some of the work, but I can't do all. I've heard that
the farm in FZ site can't work. I try to figure it out but find it's
impossible.
That site is TOO LAG for me. On other hand, I don't have so much time to
look after more than 2 sites. So I raise this problems and want every wizs
share this task. I believe every one in our wiz team can be a good admin
in the mirror site, because he has a full team backup him and can always 
goto the main site to check code and seeking for help.




